          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "试试焦油"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "petition.pitch_trap.c2" : {
      "comment" : "Petition pitch_trap: choice 2.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eure Frau hat recht"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your wife is right"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Su mujer tiene razón"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Votre femme a raison"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vostra moglie ha ragione"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "奥さんの言うとおりだ"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A sua mulher tem razão"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你妻子说得对"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "petition.pitch_trap.hint" : {
      "comment" : "Petition pitch_trap: Odile's counsel.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Seine letzte Idee war eine selbstzündende Kerze. Sie zündete seinen Hut an. Dankt ihm und schickt ihn heim."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "His last idea was a self-lighting candle. It lit his hat. Thank him and send him home."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Su última idea fue una vela que se encendía sola. Le encendió el sombrero. Dele las gracias y mándelo a casa."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sa dernière idée était une chandelle qui s’allume toute seule. Elle a allumé son chapeau. Remerciez-le et renvoyez-le chez lui."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La sua ultima idea era una candela che si accendeva da sola. Gli ha acceso il cappello. Ringraziatelo e mandatelo a casa."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "あの者の前の思いつきは、ひとりでに火のつく蝋燭でした。帽子に火がつきました。礼を言って、帰しておやりなさいませ。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A última ideia dele foi uma vela que se acendia sozinha. Acendeu o chapéu dele. Agradeça e mande-o para casa."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "他上一个主意是自己会点着的蜡烛。结果点着了他的帽子。谢过他，打发他回家。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "petition.pitch_trap.r1a" : {
      "comment" : "Petition pitch_trap: choice 1, it went well.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Gruben gehen in Flammen auf. Rußlinge strömen hinein und kommen nicht wieder heraus. Der Handwerker tanzt auf der Mauer."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The pits go up in sheets of fire. Sootlings pour in and do not come out. The builder dances on the wall."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los fosos estallan en cortinas de fuego. Los hollinejos caen dentro a montones y no salen. El albañil baila en la muralla."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les fosses s’embrasent en nappes de feu. Les fumerons s’y déversent et n’en ressortent pas. Le bâtisseur danse sur la muraille."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dalle fosse si alzano muri di fiamme. I fuligginelli ci si riversano dentro e non ne escono più. Il muratore balla sulle mura."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "杭穴が一面の炎を上げる。煤影がなだれ込み、二度と出てこない。職人は城壁の上で踊る。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Os fossos sobem em cortinas de fogo. Os fuliginhos entram aos montes e não saem. O pedreiro dança na muralha."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "坑里轰地腾起一片火海。煤影涌进去，就没再出来。工匠在城墙上手舞足蹈。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "petition.pitch_trap.r1b" : {
      "comment" : "Petition pitch_trap: choice 1, it went badly.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Teer fängt vor der Dunkelheit Feuer und brennt den ganzen Nachmittag. Seine Augenbrauen wachsen nach. Irgendwann."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The tar catches before dark and burns all afternoon. His eyebrows will grow back. Eventually."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El alquitrán prende antes de que oscurezca y arde toda la tarde. Las cejas le volverán a crecer. Algún día."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le goudron prend feu avant la nuit et brûle tout l’après-midi. Ses sourcils repousseront. Un jour."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il catrame prende fuoco prima che faccia buio e brucia per tutto il pomeriggio. Le sopracciglia gli ricresceranno. Prima o poi."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "暗くなる前に松やにに火がつき、午後いっぱい燃え続ける。眉毛はまた生えてくるだろう。いずれは。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O alcatrão pega fogo antes do escurecer e arde a tarde inteira. As sobrancelhas dele vão crescer de novo. Um dia."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "焦油天没黑就着了，烧了一下午。他的眉毛会长回来的。迟早。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "petition.pitch_trap.r2" : {
      "comment" : "Petition pitch_trap: reaction to choice 2.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Er seufzt und geht heim. Seine Frau schickt Euch einen Korb Pflaumen, was Ihr als Dank versteht."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "He sighs and goes home. His wife sends you a basket of plums, which you take as thanks."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Suspira y se va a casa. Su mujer le manda una cesta de ciruelas, que usted toma como agradecimiento."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il soupire et rentre chez lui. Sa femme vous envoie un panier de prunes, que vous prenez pour un remerciement."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sospira e torna a casa. Sua moglie vi manda un cesto di susine, che prendete come un ringraziamento."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "職人はため息をついて帰っていく。その妻から、すももがひと籠届く。礼の品と受け取っておく。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ele suspira e vai para casa. A mulher dele manda para você um cesto de ameixas, que você entende como agradecimento."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "他叹了口气，回家去了。他妻子给你送来一篮李子，你权当是谢礼。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "petition.pitch_trap.text" : {
      "comment" : "Petition pitch_trap (builder): the request.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "{Burgherr|Burgherrin}, ich habe eine Idee. Wir graben die Pfahlgruben tiefer und kleiden sie mit Teer aus, und wenn der Ruß hineinfällt: wusch! Ich brauche fünfzehn Gold für Teer. Meine Frau sagt, ich soll aufhören, Ideen zu haben."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "My {lord|lady}, I have an idea. We dig the stake pits deeper and line them with tar, and when the soot falls in: whoosh! I need fifteen gold for tar. My wife says I should stop having ideas."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "{Mi señor|Mi señora}, tengo una idea. Cavamos más hondo los fosos de estacas y los cubrimos de alquitrán, y cuando el hollín cae dentro: ¡fuuum! Necesito quince monedas de oro para alquitrán. Mi mujer dice que debería dejar de tener ideas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "{Monseigneur|Madame}, j’ai une idée. On creuse les fosses à pieux plus profond, on les tapisse de goudron, et quand la suie tombe dedans, hop, tout flambe ! Il me faut quinze pièces d’or de goudron. Ma femme dit que je devrais arrêter d’avoir des idées."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "{Mio signore|Mia signora}, ho un’idea. Scaviamo più a fondo le fosse a pali e le rivestiamo di catrame, e quando la fuliggine ci cade dentro… fuoco! Mi servono quindici monete d’oro per il catrame. Mia moglie dice che dovrei smettere di avere idee."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "城主様、思いついたことがあります。杭穴をもっと深く掘って、内側に松やにを塗るんです。煤が落ちたら、ぼうっ！　松やに代に金貨15枚いります。家内には、思いつくのはもうやめろと言われてます。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "{Meu senhor|Minha senhora}, tive uma ideia. A gente cava os fossos de estacas mais fundo e forra com alcatrão, e quando a fuligem cai lá dentro: fuuum! Preciso de quinze moedas de ouro de alcatrão. Minha mulher diz que eu devia parar de ter ideias."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "城主大人，我有个主意。我们把尖桩坑挖深些，里面抹上焦油，等煤影掉进去——呼！我需要15金币买焦油。我媳妇说，我该少出点主意。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "petition.plough_harvest.c1" : {
      "comment" : "Petition plough_harvest: choice 1.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
